      "promptZhHans": "某校数学活动小组测量校园内一棵大树的高度。他们在平地上选取相距12 m的A、B两点，在A点测得树顶C的仰角为30°，在B点测得树顶C的仰角为45°，且A、B与树底D在同一直线上。则大树CD的高度约为（参考数据：√2≈1.414，√3≈1.732）（ ）",
      "optionsZhHans": [
        "16.4 m",
        "17.0 m",
        "17.6 m",
        "18.2 m"
      ],
      "answer": "16.4 m",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "16.4 m",
        "16.4",
        "约16.4 m",
        "约为16.4 m"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "设树高CD = h m。由题意，∠CAD=30°，∠CBD=45°，AD = BD + 12。在Rt△ACD中，tan30° = CD/AD = h/AD，所以AD = h / tan30° = h√3。在Rt△BCD中，tan45° = CD/BD = h/BD，所以BD = h。由AD - BD = 12，得h√3 - h = 12，h(√3 - 1) = 12，h = 12/(√3 - 1) = 12(√3 + 1)/2 = 6(√3 + 1) ≈ 6×(1.732+1) = 6×2.732 = 16.392 ≈ 16.4 m。",
      "sourceDistanceStatus": "passed",
      "mathQaStatus": "needs-review",
      "reviewNotes": "deepseek-original-v3-1200; pending-s18-manual-review"
    },
